<title>UK: Vickers sells S&amp;W Medico to Artema.</title>
<headline>Vickers sells S&amp;W Medico to Artema.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>British engineering group Vickers Plc Plc said on Friday that it is selling S&amp;W Medico Teknik to Sweden's Artema Medical AB for around 6.5 million stg.</p>
<p>Vickers will receive payment in three instalments, which it will use as working capital. S&amp;W is part of the Vickers medical division.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
